\f0\fs22 Let's Peppol eID Bridge - Windows x64 test installer\par
\par
This installer includes the native bridge, its runtime libraries and a private Belgian eID PKCS#11 module. It does not install the global Belgian middleware.\par
\par
This is an unsigned private test build, not a public production release. The exact corresponding source for the tested Belgian DLL has not yet been established. Do not publish this test installer as a redistributable release.\par
\par
Use the official Web eID browser extension. The browser may require you to install or enable that extension. Existing native-host registrations are protected; remove the earlier PoC registration before installing.\par
\par
Operational logging is enabled in Documents\'5cLetsPeppol eID Bridge\'5cLogs. Review logs before sharing them. Your PIN stays in the native/card interaction.\par
\par
Third-party copyright and license notices are included in the installation directory. The original Web eID and Belgian government projects do not endorse this fork.\par
